{"id":"141324e7d302145d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-productive-characterization.md","title":"生产性等价于补停机集的 1 归约上锥","display":"thm-productive-characterization — 生产性等价于补停机集的 1 归约上锥","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-productive-characterization","aliases":["20-thm-productive-characterization"],"display":"thm-productive-characterization — 生产性等价于补停机集的 1 归约上锥","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.4.6(i)；Corollary 2.4.7","source_printed_pages":[39,40],"source_pdf_pages":[75,76],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-thm-productive-properties]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]","[[20-df-productive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-productive-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-productive-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-productive-characterization — 生产性等价于补停机集的 1 归约上锥"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.4.6(i)；Corollary 2.4.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"824c073fd4a6ee10\" href=\"?note=824c073fd4a6ee10\" title=\"20-lem-productive-total-injective\">20-lem-productive-total-injective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c99615f5fab6afb5\" href=\"?note=c99615f5fab6afb5\" title=\"20-thm-productive-properties\">20-thm-productive-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline K=\\omega\\setminus K\">\\(\\overline K=\\omega\\setminus K\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"824c073fd4a6ee10\" href=\"?note=824c073fd4a6ee10\" title=\"20-lem-productive-total-injective\">20-lem-productive-total-injective</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c99615f5fab6afb5\" href=\"?note=c99615f5fab6afb5\" title=\"20-thm-productive-properties\">20-thm-productive-properties</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}productive\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline K\\le_1 P\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline K\\le_m P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}productive\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline K\\le_1 P\\Longleftrightarrow\\overline K\\le_m P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对全且单射生产函数 p，用单射参数递归定理得到 n(y)，满足 W_n(y)={p(n(y))} 若 y∈K，否则为空。y∈K 时 p(n(y)) 若在 P，会与生产性冲突，故不在 P；y∉K 时空域触发生产性，给 p(n(y))∈P。故单射 p∘n 见证 K̄≤₁P。K̄ 由恒等函数生产：W_e⊆K̄ 时 e∉W_e，否则 e∈K 与包含冲突，于是 e∈K̄\\W_e。many-one 向上保持完成反向。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.4.6(i)；Corollary 2.4.7；印刷页 39, 40；PDF 第 75, 76 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-productive-total-injective","status":"resolved","id":"824c073fd4a6ee10","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","status":"resolved","id":"4f81acfa76416d15","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-productive-properties","status":"resolved","id":"c99615f5fab6afb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-productive-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved",